+# Website product queries
+
+Seller → Booking → Query (`#/seller/query`) lists enquiries from the website's `product query` table, including contact details and product snapshots. Search and status filters apply across all records, with 50 records per page. This is a seller-only, read-only view. Anonymous visitors and buyer accounts cannot access `/api/product-queries`.
+
+Production uses the existing `baji-market-reviews` D1 database, bound as `REVIEWS_DB` on both apps. Before deploying, apply only `website-migrations/0003_product_query.sql` to that database. Do not bulk-apply historical market migrations. The local adapter reads `../baji-market-website/.data/reviews.sqlite`. Inventory data is unchanged.
+
+Check: `node --experimental-sqlite --import tsx --test src/productQueries.test.ts src/security.test.ts`, followed by `npm run build`.
